#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:46
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.employer"
msgid "Scarlet Mansion Household & Time Office"
msgstr "紅魔館 家政・時間管理室"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:47
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.title"
msgid "Zero-minute night maid & fairy-colleague recovery clerk"
msgstr "0分夜勤メイド兼・妖精同僚回収係"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:54
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Dinner, broken windows, and the vampire's morning must occur in order; the "
"duty chief decides separately whether time elapsed."
msgstr "晩餐、割れた窓、吸血鬼の朝を順に完了。時間が経過したかは当直長が別途決定する。"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:55
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Polish silver, recover fairy maids collapsed beside tea trays, and file "
"three broken windows in one minute as separate incidents."
msgstr "銀器整理、茶盆脇で倒れた妖精メイドの回収、同一分の窓割れ三件を別事故票へ。"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:56
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Room, board, and uniform. Pay by negotiation with the mistress. Stopped time "
"counts as neither overtime nor rest."
msgstr "衣食住・制服支給。給与は館主と相談。停止時間は残業にも休憩にも算入しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:57
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Applicants may not cite “zero minutes” as no work. The mansion may not cite "
"it as no pay. The latter sentence remains circled in red."
msgstr "応募者は「0分」を理由に未勤務を主張不可。館側も未払いを主張不可。後半は赤丸で審議中。"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:58
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Set tea before one sugar cube falls, and ensure at least one fairy colleague "
"remembers clocking out."
msgstr "角砂糖が落ちる前に茶席を整え、妖精同僚一名以上に退勤を覚えさせる。"

#. employmentJobs.0.0.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:59
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.0.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Sakuya reserved minute zero for interview. Meiling says falling asleep at "
"the gate can count as check-in."
msgstr "咲夜が面談の第0分を確保。美鈴は門前で眠れば出勤証明をすると言っている。"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:65
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.employer"
msgid "Kappa Cooperative Workshop"
msgstr "河童工学共同工房"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:66
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.title"
msgid "Day-129 temporary repair & tool-colleague engineer"
msgstr "129日目の仮修理・工具同僚関係技師"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:73
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.summary"
msgid ""
"The turbine normally smokes; if it does not, check whether it stopped. Tape "
"colour marks versions unless Nitori changed that yesterday."
msgstr "水車は通常発煙。煙がなければ停止を確認。テープ色は版を示すが、にとりが昨日変更した場合を除く。"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:74
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Calibrate incompatible gauges, log leak speed, and decide whether an "
"overtime-claiming wrench is equipment, colleague, or witness."
msgstr "互換性のない計器調整、漏水速度記録、レンチの残業申請時に工具・同僚・証人を判定。"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:75
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Yen, cucumbers, and patent credit are settled separately. One identifiable "
"post-explosion part may be taken home."
msgstr "円・胡瓜・特許名義を別欄精算。爆発後も識別できる部品を一点持帰り可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:76
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.clause"
msgid ""
"“Temporary” describes the repair, not employment. Renewal on day 130 "
"requires one more tape layer."
msgstr "「仮」は修理のみを指し雇用を指さない。130日目はテープを一層追加して更新。"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:77
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Make three mutually hostile gauges agree which is most wrong; do not call "
"their average a repair."
msgstr "互いを認めない圧力計三台に、最も誤った一台を合意させる。平均を修理と呼ばない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.1.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:78
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.1.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Nitori finds your odd résumé dismantle-worthy and scheduled a trial at the "
"next controllable leak."
msgstr "にとりは怪歴書に分解価値ありと判断。次の制御可能な漏水時に試用予定。"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:84
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.employer"
msgid "Sanzu Queue Appeals Office"
msgstr "三途川 待列不服申立所"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:85
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.title"
msgid "Posthumous queue appeals clerk & relief ferryperson"
msgstr "死後待列不服係・渡し船補欠"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:92
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Handle the dead, not-yet-dead, disputed death dates, and applicants born "
"after receiving a queue number."
msgstr "死亡済・未死亡・死亡日に異議・番号札取得後に出生した申請者を扱う。"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:93
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Check coins, hear queue appeals, and leave traceable reasons for the half of "
"the route Komachi did not row."
msgstr "銭勘定、待列異議聴取、小町が漕ぎ残した半分へ追跡可能な理由を残す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:94
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Paid per crossing, soul, or surviving queue ticket. Passage priority may not "
"be resold to your not-yet-dead self."
msgstr "便・魂・現存番号札のいずれかで精算。渡河優先権を未死亡の自分へ転売不可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:95
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Late fees begin one day before death; successful appeals may convert one day "
"into a chronology dispute."
msgstr "遅延料は死亡前日から計上。異議成功時は一日を「年代係争」へ変更可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:96
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Before Eiki finishes asking, explain whether a half-phantom queues once, "
"twice, or makes the queue admit miscounting."
msgstr "映姫の質問終了前に半霊が一列・二列・待列側の数え直しか説明。"

#. employmentJobs.0.2.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:97
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.2.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Komachi placed the interview after her nap; Eiki corrected “after the nap” "
"into an unavoidable date."
msgstr "小町は面談を昼寝後へ設定。映姫は「昼寝後」を回避不能な日付へ訂正した。"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:103
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.employer"
msgid "Bunbunmaru News Corrections & Early Dispatch"
msgstr "『文々。新聞』訂正・早着発送台"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:104
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.title"
msgid "Tomorrow-headline advance retraction clerk"
msgstr "明日の見出し事前撤回係"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:111
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.summary"
msgid "Retract an error not yet published, then catch Aya and ask what she plans to write."
msgstr "未掲載の誤報を先に撤回し、文へ追いついて何を書くか確認。"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:112
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Keep every headline version, redact an anonymous source's self-shouted name, "
"and classify the nine-fast clock as equipment rather than evidence."
msgstr "見出し全版保存、自ら叫んだ匿名情報源の名を伏せ、9分進む時計を証拠でなく設備として記録。"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:113
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Copy fee, wind-route passes, and first-edition byline; retracted bylines "
"remain in Corrections."
msgstr "原稿料・風路券・初版署名。初版撤回時も署名は撤回欄へ残る。"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:114
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.clause"
msgid ""
"News may arrive before events; wages may not. Aya claims source protection "
"over the latter sentence."
msgstr "新聞は事件より早着可、賃金は不可。文は後半へ情報源保護を主張。"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:115
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Write a thirty-character correction naming the error; “caused confusion” may "
"not substitute for a subject."
msgstr "30字で訂正し、誤りを明示。「誤解を招いた」で主語を代替しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.3.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:116
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.3.0.reply"
msgid "The desk shortlisted you for edition two; edition one already says you declined comment."
msgstr "編集台は第二版候補へ登録。初版には既に「取材拒否」と掲載済み。"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:122
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.employer"
msgid "Hakurei Shrine Donation Box & Boundary Duty"
msgstr "博麗神社 賽銭箱・境界合同当番"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:123
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.title"
msgid "Offering whereabouts auditor & boundary-leaf sweeper"
msgstr "賽銭行方監査・境界落葉清掃員"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:130
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Sweep leaves fallen from Outside and retain coins fallen from Outside; the "
"two often impersonate each other."
msgstr "外から落ちた葉を掃き、外から落ちた硬貨を残す。両者はよく互いに化ける。"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:131
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Patrol the torii, ask why the donation box is in Administration again, and "
"hold Reimu's “hiring suspended” sign during incidents."
msgstr "鳥居巡回、賽銭箱が再び学務課にある理由確認、異変時に霊夢の「採用停止」札を持つ。"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:132
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.pay"
msgid "Share offerings after tea costs. If negative, receive a warding charm and one meal."
msgstr "当日賽銭から茶代を引き分配。負なら厄除札と一食へ変更。"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:133
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Reimu may forget publishing the vacancy. This notice entitles you to one "
"“I'll take a look.”"
msgstr "霊夢は求人掲載を忘れる場合あり。本広告提示で一回の「ちょっと見る」。"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:134
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.trial"
msgid ""
"When Yukari opens two identically named torii, identify which side to sweep. "
"“The one with more offerings” is accepted."
msgstr "紫が同名鳥居を二つ開いた際、掃く側を答える。「賽銭が多い側」可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.4.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:135
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.4.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Reimu provisionally agrees to interview if you place this reply in the "
"donation box and retrieve it from the back yourself."
msgstr "霊夢は面談へ暫定同意。本返信を賽銭箱へ入れ、裏から自力で取り出すこと。"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:141
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.employer"
msgid "Kourindou Outside-Object Non-sales Department"
msgstr "香霖堂 外界品・非売部"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:142
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.title"
msgid "Use-naming apprentice & unsold-stock companion"
msgstr "用途命名見習・売れない在庫面談員"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:149
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Assign Outside drift objects their most confident wrong uses, then await "
"corrections from wear, object, and customer."
msgstr "外界漂流物へ最も自信ある誤用途を書き、摩耗・物件・客の訂正を待つ。"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:150
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Count unsold goods, stop Marisa relabelling borrowing as collaboration, and "
"hear a radio's complaint about having no station."
msgstr "非売品棚卸、魔理沙の「借用」を研究協力と記すのを阻止、放送局のないラジオの不服聴取。"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:151
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.pay"
msgid "Paid in an unknown-use object appraised as valuable. Cash follows if it ever sells."
msgstr "用途不明だが霖之助が高価と判定した品で支給。現金は実売後に追給。"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:152
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.clause"
msgid "Apprentices may disagree with the proprietor; disagreement forms receive price tags."
msgstr "店主への異議可。ただし異議書には値札が付く。"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:153
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Without opening it, explain why a USB cable may not be a snake, leaving "
"space for the snake's objection."
msgstr "分解せずUSB線が蛇でない可能性を説明。蛇の異議欄を残す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.5.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:154
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.5.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Rinnosuke appraised your application as a “folding personnel manual,” "
"provisionally worth more than the wage."
msgstr "霖之助は願書を「折畳み人事説明書」と鑑定。暫定価格は賃金より高い。"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:160
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.employer"
msgid "Eientei Moonlit Handover Office"
msgstr "永遠亭 月夜引継室"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:161
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.title"
msgid "Immortal-patient night handover & moon-rabbit relief"
msgstr "不死患者夜勤引継・月兎欠勤補位"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:168
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.summary"
msgid "A patient may be unable to die while their chart can; handover must protect both."
msgstr "患者が死ななくても病歴は死に得る。引継は両方を守る。"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:169
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Check prescriptions, escort lost patients, and find a more plausible excuse "
"for rabbits calling in sick with Hourai elixir."
msgstr "処方確認、迷子患者同行、蓬莱薬で欠勤しようとする月兎へ可信な理由探し。"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:170
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Yen, bamboo shoots, and night-shift medicinal tea. Immortality does not make "
"probation infinite."
msgstr "円・筍・夜勤薬茶。不死は無期限試用期間を意味しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:171
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Full-moon overtime may be refused, but the refusal must be handed to a "
"rabbit not planning to flee that night."
msgstr "満月夜は残業拒否可。ただし逃亡予定のない月兎へ拒否票を渡す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:172
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Hand one chart to Eirin, Reisen, and the patient without giving all three "
"the same secret."
msgstr "同一病歴を永琳・鈴仙・本人へ渡し、三者が同じ秘密を受け取らないようにする。"

#. employmentJobs.0.6.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:173
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.6.0.reply"
msgid "Reisen sent a low-gaze interview route; the lunar phase will decide it after you arrive."
msgstr "鈴仙が視線回避面談路を送付。月相により到着後に経路決定。"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:179
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.employer"
msgid "Hakugyokurou Phantom Roll & Banquet Logistics"
msgstr "白玉楼 幽霊名簿・宴席調度係"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:180
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.title"
msgid "Half-phantom headcount dispute recorder"
msgstr "半霊人数係争記録員"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:187
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Roll, seats, and the count after Yuyuko eats never agree; preserve the "
"difference rather than reconcile it."
msgstr "点呼数・席数・幽々子の食後残数は常に異なる。仕事は差を保存し一致させないこと。"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:188
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Separate people, half-phantoms, passing ghosts, and self-declared petals, "
"and stop the banquet treating the roll as a menu."
msgstr "妖夢のため人・半霊・通過中の幽霊・花弁自称を分け、宴席が名簿を献立にしないようにする。"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:189
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.pay"
msgid "Room, board, cherry-season allowance, and desserts not requisitioned by Yuyuko."
msgstr "館内食住・桜季手当・幽々子に指名されなかった甘味。"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:190
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.clause"
msgid ""
"If spring fails to arrive, the contract is not extended; the vacancy is "
"temporarily renamed winter."
msgstr "春が届かなければ契約延長せず「冬季求人」へ改称。"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:191
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.trial"
msgid "Seat Youmu and her phantom in one and a half chairs without sawing furniture."
msgstr "妖夢と半霊へ椅子1.5脚を手配。椅子を切らない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.7.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:192
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.7.0.reply"
msgid "Youmu approved the interview; Yuyuko added one seat because “it looks delicious.”"
msgstr "妖夢が面談承認。幽々子が一席追加、理由は「おいしそう」。"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:198
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.employer"
msgid "Scarlet Underground Library Flying-Book Herd"
msgstr "紅魔館地下図書館 飛行蔵書牧養班"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:199
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.title"
msgid "Low-oxygen flying-book shepherd"
msgstr "低酸素書群誘導員"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:206
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.summary"
msgid "Some books fly, some bite; worst are those insisting they are merely references."
msgstr "飛ぶ本、噛む本、そして自分は参考資料にすぎないと言い張る最難関の本。"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:207
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Recover books before windows close, log oxygen and visitors for Koakuma, and "
"prevent Marisa recording a repeat borrowing as the first."
msgstr "閉窓前の蔵書回収、小悪魔の酸素・来客記録、魔理沙の再借用を初回扱いさせない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:208
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Underground lodging, tea, and limited collection access. Wage envelopes may "
"be inside a book refusing return."
msgstr "地下食住・茶・限定閲覧。賃金袋が返却拒否本に挟まる場合あり。"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:209
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Log dust, magic, and low oxygen separately. “Patchouli is used to it” is not "
"protective equipment."
msgstr "埃・魔力・低酸素は別記。「パチュリーは慣れている」は保護具ではない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:210
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.trial"
msgid "Return a grimoire to its shelf voluntarily without reading its title aloud."
msgstr "書名を読まずに禁書を自発的に棚へ戻す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.8.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:211
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.8.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Koakuma shelved your application with returns; if it flies back first, round "
"one is passed."
msgstr "小悪魔が願書を返架待ちへ。先に飛び戻れば一次通過。"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:217
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.employer"
msgid "Moriya Shrine Faith-Grid Division"
msgstr "守矢神社 信仰電網事業部"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:218
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.title"
msgid "Merit-and-kilowatt split-ledger accountant"
msgstr "神徳・キロワット別欄会計"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:225
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Settle faith, hydropower, and miracles separately, keeping three signature "
"boxes when three supervisors claim sole authority."
msgstr "信仰・水力・奇跡を別精算し、三上司が唯一責任者を名乗る際は三署名欄を残す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:226
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Reconcile offerings, turbine output, and Sanae's Outside conversion sheet; "
"stop Kanako booking Suwako's earth as free input."
msgstr "香火・水車出力・早苗の外界換算表を確認。神奈子が諏訪子の地脈を無料原料扱いするのを止める。"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:227
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Yen and merit in separate columns. Merit cannot be cashed but counts as "
"seniority in shrine debates."
msgstr "円と神徳を別欄。神徳は換金不可、社内議論では経歴として使用可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:228
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Miracles are not performance guarantees. Unhappened miracles remain "
"receivable and may not be written off by advance worship."
msgstr "奇跡は成果保証でない。未発生奇跡は未収計上し、先行祭祀で相殺不可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:229
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Report one kilowatt-hour to all three supervisors without letting anyone "
"claim they were averaged away."
msgstr "同じ1kWhを三責任者へ報告し、誰も平均で消されたと言えないようにする。"

#. employmentJobs.0.9.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:230
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.9.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Sanae sent an Outside-style invitation; Kanako sealed it, while Suwako "
"proposed another time from the reverse."
msgstr "早苗が外界様式で面談招待。神奈子が押印、諏訪子が紙裏から別時刻を提示。"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:236
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.employer"
msgid "Myouren Temple Night Commons"
msgstr "命蓮寺 夜間共同食卓"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:237
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.title"
msgid "Human-youkai dinner mediator & late-arrival plate keeper"
msgstr "人妖夕食調停・遅着者取り置き係"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:244
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Everyone may sit without agreeing who owns the table—especially since the "
"table began speaking."
msgstr "全員着席可能でも卓の所有合意は別。特に最近、卓が発言を始めた。"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:245
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Keep dietary rules distinct, manage Kyouko's echoes, and write down the "
"actual dispute before Byakuren mediates."
msgstr "食規則を分け、響子の反響を調整し、白蓮の仲裁前に争点を記す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:246
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.pay"
msgid "Meals, lodging, and Village yen; if dinner becomes a service, sesame cakes are added."
msgstr "食住・里円。夕食が法会になれば香油餅を追加。"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:247
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Mediation need not make everyone agreeable; success means they still share "
"the entrance tomorrow."
msgstr "調停は全員を仲良くすることではない。翌日も入口共有を望むことが成功。"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:248
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Share one pot among an umbrella youkai, beast, and youkai-fearing human "
"without seating anyone at an invisible table."
msgstr "唐傘・妖獣・妖怪を怖がる人間で茶一壺を分け、誰も見えない卓へ追いやらない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.10.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:249
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.10.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Byakuren invites you to a dinner interview; Kyouko's echo delivered it to "
"yesterday's valley."
msgstr "白蓮が夕食面談へ招待。響子の反響は昨日の谷へ届いた。"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:255
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.employer"
msgid "Chireiden Mind-Reading Redaction Office"
msgstr "地霊殿 心読遮蔽・欠字記録室"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:256
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.title"
msgid "Unwritable-content stenographer"
msgstr "書けない内容の速記員"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:263
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Record what was read and not consented for use, without smuggling the "
"content back inside brackets."
msgstr "読まれた内容と利用同意なしを完全記録。ただし内容自体を括弧へ戻さない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:264
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Preserve sources for Satori's blanks, attendance traces for Koishi's unseen "
"collisions, and stop Orin carrying away annexes still speaking."
msgstr "さとりの空白出典、こいしの見えないが衝突した出席痕跡を残し、燐が発話中附件を運ばないようにする。"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:265
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Underground yen, heat, and unspoken meal preferences. Thoughts do not count "
"as voluntary overtime."
msgstr "地底円・暖房・言わなくてよい食事希望。心声は自発残業に算入しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:266
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.clause"
msgid ""
"An employer reading your intent to quit is not resignation, though handover "
"may be prepared early."
msgstr "雇主が退職意思を読んでも退職届ではない。ただし引継は先に準備する。"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:267
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.trial"
msgid "Write minutes everyone understands and nobody can reverse into the secret."
msgstr "全員が理解でき、誰も秘密を復元できない議事録を書く。"

#. employmentJobs.0.11.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:268
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.11.0.reply"
msgid "Satori says she knows whether you'll attend; Personnel still requires your own reply."
msgstr "さとりは来否を把握済み。人事室は本人の返信を待つよう要求。"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:274
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.employer"
msgid "Alice Doll Workshop Labour Desk"
msgstr "アリス人形工房 労働関係机"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:275
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.title"
msgid "Doll-union & control-thread responsibility examiner"
msgstr "人形組合・操糸責任調査員"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:282
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.summary"
msgid ""
"A doll asks for rest while its thread proves it did not move itself "
"yesterday; both statements need chairs."
msgstr "人形は休憩要求、操糸は昨日自走なしを証明。両陳述へ席が必要。"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:283
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Record autonomous, remote, and silent dolls; trace materials borrowed by "
"Marisa; prepare a negotiation table that cannot be cut."
msgstr "自律・遠隔・意見不明人形を記録し、魔理沙に借りられた材料の出典追跡、切れない交渉卓を用意。"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:284
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Yen, handmade parts, and one volunteering doll. The doll itself may not be "
"booked as wages."
msgstr "円・手作部品・自願同行人形一体。人形自体を賃金として記載不可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:285
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.clause"
msgid "Remote-controlled applicants remain valid, but operator and body check in separately."
msgstr "応募者が遠隔操作でも面談有効。ただし操作者と身体は別签到。"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:286
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.trial"
msgid "Have three dolls overrule Alice once without cutting a thread."
msgstr "糸を切らず人形三体でアリスを一度否決する。"

#. employmentJobs.0.12.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:287
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.12.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Shanghai carried off your application and Hourai returned another; Alice "
"wants to know which is yours."
msgstr "上海人形が願書を持去り、蓬莱人形が別紙を返却。アリスはどちらが本人分か確認中。"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:293
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.employer"
msgid "Prismriver Ensemble Silence-Incident Desk"
msgstr "プリズムリバー楽団 無音事故台"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:294
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.title"
msgid "Non-airborne sound stage technician"
msgstr "空気を通らない音の舞台技師"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:301
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Earplugs stop air, not the third beat sounding inside the mind; work begins "
"by admitting the earplugs are not at fault."
msgstr "耳栓は空気を止めるが心内の第三拍は止めない。耳栓は悪くないと認める所から始まる。"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:302
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Rig stages, log inaudible bands, recover Lunasa's lost mood, and stop Merlin "
"counting runaway volume as audience enthusiasm."
msgstr "舞台設営、不可聴帯記録、ルナサの失せた感情回収、メルランの暴走音量を観客熱と数えない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:303
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.pay"
msgid "Highest of per-show, per-echo, or remembered tunes. Silence counts as a performance."
msgstr "公演・反響・観客記憶曲数の最高額。沈黙も一公演。"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:304
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Inaudibility is not non-exposure. Recovery leave does not require "
"professionally impressive tinnitus."
msgstr "聞こえないことは非曝露でない。療養日に専門的な耳鳴証明不要。"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:305
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.trial"
msgid "Safely stop the stage while the ensemble performs and denies performing."
msgstr "楽団が演奏と非演奏を同時主張中に安全停止。"

#. employmentJobs.0.13.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:306
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.13.0.reply"
msgid ""
"The sisters replied hire, waitlist, and key change; the ensemble will decide "
"which is melody after rehearsal."
msgstr "三姉妹は採用・補欠・転調を別々に回答。合奏後に主旋律を決定。"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:312
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.employer"
msgid "Misty Lake Fairy Ice Reserve & Forgotten-Class Office"
msgstr "霧の湖 妖精氷庫・忘課室"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:313
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.title"
msgid "Melt-loss & repeat-graduation roll clerk"
msgstr "融解損耗・重複卒業点呼係"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:320
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.summary"
msgid ""
"The ice reserve shrinks daily while Cirno graduates once more; neither "
"number accepts being called loss."
msgstr "氷庫は日々減り、チルノは日々一回多く卒業。両数とも損耗扱いを拒む。"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:321
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Measure ice, draw attendance, and decide whether to rename verse three or "
"reteach verse two."
msgstr "氷量測定、画像出席、妖精が二番を忘れたら三番改名か再授業を決める。"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:322
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.pay"
msgid "Ice, berries, and Village pocket money. Summer ice wages deduct commuting melt first."
msgstr "氷・木苺・里小遣い。夏季氷給は通勤融解を先に控除。"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:323
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Forgetting work is not automatically absence; first prove the day's "
"timetable was remembered."
msgstr "出勤忘れは自動欠勤でない。当日の時間割が記憶された証明が先。"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:324
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.trial"
msgid "Have Cirno draw herself only once on the same attendance picture."
msgstr "チルノに同じ出席絵へ自画像を一度だけ描かせる。"

#. employmentJobs.0.14.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:325
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.14.0.reply"
msgid "The ice fairy says you're hired; Daiyousei added “ask the applicant first.”"
msgstr "氷精は採用済みと主張。大妖精が「本人に確認」と追記。"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:331
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.employer"
msgid "Hieda Five-Records-of-One-Matter Room"
msgstr "稗田邸 同件五記録室"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:332
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.title"
msgid "Disbelieved-version preservation clerk"
msgstr "信じない版の保存員"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:339
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.summary"
msgid "Preserve one record you disbelieve, may not delete, and must keep source-findable."
msgstr "信じないが削除できず、出典も検索可能にする記録を保存。"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:340
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Link the chronicle to its source revisions, track what each merge brought "
"in, and file Aya's extra beside the evidence."
msgstr "大学史と元の改訂を結び、取り込まれた変更を確かめ、文の号外を証拠の隣に綴じる。"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:341
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.pay"
msgid "Village yen, paper and ink, plus one monthly right to say “I already documented this.”"
msgstr "里円・紙墨・月一回の「前に書いた」権。"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:342
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Corrections never overwrite version one; if version one vanishes, suspect "
"the correction first."
msgstr "訂正は初版を上書きしない。初版消失時は訂正を先に疑う。"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:343
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Arrange the official file, bell log, BBS, extra, and Git version in five "
"columns without choosing a winner."
msgstr "同一事案の正式記録・鐘楼log・BBS・号外・Git版を五欄にし、勝者を選ばない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.15.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:344
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.15.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Akyuu says your application contradicts yesterday's copy; both are on the "
"candidate shelf."
msgstr "阿求によると願書は昨日版と矛盾。両方とも候補棚へ。"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:350
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.employer"
msgid "Blazing Hell Ruins Heat & Cat-Cart Accounts"
msgstr "灼熱地獄跡 熱量・猫車会計"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:351
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.title"
msgid "Geothermal quota & fuel-aliveness assessor"
msgstr "地熱枠・燃料生存判定員"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:358
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Determine whether fuel came to work or work came to be fuel; Orin requires "
"different carts."
msgstr "燃料が勤務に来たか、勤務が燃料化かを確認。燐は別々の猫車を要求。"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:359
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Copy heat ledgers, mark the fusion bird's mood, and stop Okuu converting "
"“bright today” directly into stable output."
msgstr "熱量表、核融合鳥の気分記録、空の「今日は明るい」を安定出力へ直換算しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:360
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.pay"
msgid "Yen, geothermal quota, and unlimited winter heat. Summer heating cannot be cashed."
msgstr "円・地熱枠・冬季無限暖房。夏季暖房は換金不可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:361
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Heat tolerance is not consent to ignition. Claims must be filed before the "
"cat cart arrives."
msgstr "耐熱は点火同意でない。保険請求は猫車到着前に提出。"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:362
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Without approaching the core, persuade Okuu to reduce output from “sun” to "
"“one classroom.”"
msgstr "炉心へ近づかず空に出力を「太陽」から教室一室へ下げさせる。"

#. employmentJobs.0.16.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:363
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.16.0.reply"
msgid "Orin brought an interview cart; Personnel insists it does not imply an outcome."
msgstr "燐が面談用猫車を準備。人事室は結果の示唆ではないと強調。"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:369
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.employer"
msgid "Human Village Nightwatch & Rumour Order Office"
msgstr "人里夜巡・噂前後室"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:370
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.title"
msgid "Not-yet-happened rumour nightwatch"
msgstr "未発生噂の夜警"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:377
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Decide whether a rumour preceded, followed, or was caused by verification; "
"do not report the third as the first."
msgstr "噂が事件の前後か、検証で発生したか判定。第三を第一として報告不可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:378
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Patrol, interview shops, separate witnessing from “everyone knows,” and "
"persuade Keine not to eat an unverifiable evening whole."
msgstr "夜巡・聞取・実見と「皆知っている」を別欄、慧音が検証困難な夜を丸ごと食べないよう説得。"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:379
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.pay"
msgid "Village yen, supper, and leave for erased nights; restored history decides the date."
msgstr "里円・夜食・削除夜の代休。日付は復元後の歴史が決定。"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:380
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.clause"
msgid "Nightwatch may fear youkai; fear itself is not eyewitness evidence."
msgstr "夜警は妖怪を恐れてよい。恐怖自体を目撃証拠にしない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:381
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.trial"
msgid ""
"Verify “a bridge princess on the bridge” without escalating it to two "
"incidents when she becomes jealous."
msgstr "「橋に橋姫」の噂を検証。橋姫が怒っても二件へ増やさない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.17.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:382
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.17.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Nightwatch invites you tonight. Aya already praised last night's work; do "
"not fabricate last night to match."
msgstr "夜巡隊は今夜の試歩へ招待。文は昨夜の安定勤務を報道済みだが、昨夜を捏造しないこと。"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:388
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.employer"
msgid "Hakurei Border Drift-Object & Moving-Gate Customs"
msgstr "博麗辺境 外界漂流物・門位置関所"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:389
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.title"
msgid "Moving-gate customs declarant"
msgstr "移動する門の通関員"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:396
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.summary"
msgid ""
"Before checking where an item came from, determine which side of the gate "
"currently contains “where.”"
msgstr "物品の出所確認前に、門が現在「どこ」をどちら側へ置くか確認。"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:397
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Register phones, umbrellas, and unclaimed degrees, recording Yukari's verbal "
"exception without making it next time's precedent."
msgstr "携帯・傘・誰も認めない卒業証を登録し、紫の口頭便宜を次回先例にならない形で記録。"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:398
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.pay"
msgid "Yen, Outside trinkets, and one lawful crossing without destination guarantee."
msgstr "円・外界小物・目的地保証なしの合法通過一回。"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:399
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.clause"
msgid ""
"Customs is not liable if the gate moves during interview. Late applicants "
"may show timely arrival on the other side."
msgstr "面談中の門移動は関所免責。遅刻時は別側へ定刻到着した証拠を提出可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:400
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.trial"
msgid "Clear an Outside umbrella without assuming it lacks its own travel purpose."
msgstr "外界の傘を通関し、傘自身の旅目的を否定しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.18.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:401
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.18.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Yukari approves reporting through nonexistent Gate Three; Reimu adds “come "
"through the front first.”"
msgstr "紫は存在しない第三門からの出勤を許可。霊夢が「まず正門へ」と追記。"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:407
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.employer"
msgid "Moon Rabbit Yesterday-Line Shuttle"
msgstr "月兎 昨日線シャトル班"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:408
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.title"
msgid "Yesterday-destination ticket & carriage attendant"
msgstr "行先が昨日の乗車券・乗務員"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:415
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.summary"
msgid ""
"A ticket saying yesterday may not mean the passenger wants to return; the "
"machine may lag the moon by one day."
msgstr "切符の昨日は帰還希望とは限らず、券売機が月相より一日遅いだけかもしれない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:416
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Inspect tickets, guide Reisen's low-gaze passengers, and find at least one "
"rabbit from tomorrow during mass sick leave."
msgstr "検札、鈴仙の視線回避客対応、因幡一斉欠勤時に明日出身者を一名探す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:417
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Highest of run, lunar phase, or actual arrivals. Yesterday Line does not pay "
"minus one day's wage."
msgstr "便・月相・実到着数の最高額。昨日線でもマイナス一日賃金はない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:418
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.clause"
msgid "Crew may not correct a passenger's yesterday, only mark which yesterday boarded."
msgstr "乗務員は乗客の昨日を勝手に訂正せず、乗車した昨日のみ記す。"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:419
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.trial"
msgid "Transfer a tomorrow-ticket passenger today onto Yesterday Line without double charging."
msgstr "明日券の客を今日、二重徴収なしで昨日線へ乗換。"

#. employmentJobs.0.19.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:420
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.19.0.reply"
msgid ""
"Your interview ticket was punched yesterday; if intact today, file a version "
"dispute at the rabbit window."
msgstr "面談券は昨日改札済み。今日も無傷なら月兎窓口へ版異議を。"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.employer
#: src/data/employment.js:426
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.employer"
msgid "Tsukumogami Labour & Property Joint Desk"
msgstr "付喪神 労働・物権合同机"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.title
#: src/data/employment.js:427
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.title"
msgid "Tool, worker, or employer status conciliator"
msgstr "工具・従業員・雇主 三択仲裁員"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.summary
#: src/data/employment.js:434
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.summary"
msgid ""
"A wrench claims overtime, a drum performance rights, and a teacup the entire "
"lounge; fill in the job title after hearing."
msgstr "レンチは残業、鼓は出演権、茶碗は休憩室全体を主張。職名は聴聞後記入。"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.duty
#: src/data/employment.js:435
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.duty"
msgid ""
"Seat objects, separate ownership from employment, and identify the exhibit "
"when Kogasa testifies for an umbrella."
msgstr "物件席を用意、所有権と労働関係を分け、小傘が傘へ証言する際に証物を確認。"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.pay
#: src/data/employment.js:436
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.pay"
msgid ""
"Yen and tribunal-approved tool access. A tool currently appealing may not be "
"used as wages."
msgstr "円と裁定同意済み工具の使用権。係争中工具を賃金に使用不可。"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.clause
#: src/data/employment.js:437
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.clause"
msgid "Your furniture may join negotiations; if it becomes a party, that day's meeting stands."
msgstr "机椅が交渉参加する場合あり。当事者化した日は立会議。"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.trial
#: src/data/employment.js:438
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.trial"
msgid "Hear wrench, workshop, and user separately without closing as “everyone has a point.”"
msgstr "レンチ・工房・使用者を別々に聴き、「皆一理」で終結しない。"

#. employmentJobs.0.20.0.reply
#: src/data/employment.js:439
msgctxt "text:employmentJobs.0.20.0.reply"
msgid ""
"The tribunal confirms receipt; the application paper itself requests "
"co-applicant status."
msgstr "仲裁所は願書受領を確認。願書用紙本人も共同応募を要求。"

#. employmentCategoryOptions.0.0.1
#: src/data/employment.js:444
msgctxt "text:employmentCategoryOptions.0.0.1"
msgid "All trouble"
msgstr "すべての厄介事"

